# Fixed defect 2621, 2026-11-20, lane umbrella-3: `heroes fetch` after an
# entry's version was moved by hand in the catalogue placed the new tree and
# left the old one beside it, which no line named. A run that places every
# entry asks each tree no entry names: the part of `kit` 1.0.0 its `packages`
# line placed, and the whole of `strings` 1.0.0, each summing to the key its
# folder's name holds, go, a line each; the second fetch keeps both trees the
# catalogue names and says nothing more.
use <kit>/csv
use <strings>/cut

function main()
    print(csv.first("one,two"))
    print(cut.cut())
